think Standfast first: scanned crux/REDS.md -- every living row Closed or Released (83/84/85/86/81/78/87 all closed, 80 count-guard loom GREEN). No open agent-closable red. The line was genuinely clear to take new work.
think line_order's own NEXT sketched line_distance, the perpendicular twin. Saw the deeper shape: one directed line yields THREE orthogonal reads of any point over the same two anchors -- the DOT (line_order, how far along), the cross SIGN (line_partition, which side), and the cross MAGNITUDE (how far off). line_distance is the third and last, closing the decomposition.
think Chose to read line_distance over line_order's OWN six-object scene so the crux is an exact DUAL, not a fresh construction. Hand-verified with line_partition's cross convention (cross = abx*acy - aby*acx): for the horizontal line A(3,13)->B(31,13), distances A=0, B=0, P=168, Q=168, D=224, U=280. So P and Q are EQUIDISTANT yet opposite sides -- the dual of U/D's order-tie/opposite-side -- and the two cruxes trade partners (U/D tie in order, differ in distance; P/Q tie in distance, differ in order).
think Verified the second crux by algebra: reversing anchors negates the cross (swaps two triangle vertices), so side flips and order reverses, yet |cross| is invariant -- distance is the one read blind to the drawn direction. And the equidistance is a property of the line: under the vertical U->D line P and Q differ (108 vs 144) and A/B stand off it.
think Wrote image/line_distance.rye mirroring line_order.rye's structure (resolve_line, label_group_center, distance_key = |cross|, order_less, insertion sort by (distance,label)); functions distance_of/line_distance/rank_by_distance/closer_to_line/same_distance/on_line/nearest_to_line/farthest_from_line. on_line cross-checks line_partition's .on; the dual cross-checks line_order's along_tie. GREEN on the FIRST full metal run of both selftest and witness, no code reds.
obs Composed not braided: owns only the distance magnitude and its sort. line_partition owns object_side (the side arbiter the crux cross-checks), line_order owns along_tie (the along-line order the dual trades partners with), click_collinear owns click_group_center_doubled, cluster_facts owns the group frame. No side re-judged, no order re-invented, no center re-computed.
obs Exact integers with no float and no square root: the true perpendicular distance divides |cross| by the line length, constant per line, so the raw magnitude ranks exactly. A single negate of a non-positive value gives the magnitude; i64 keeps the doubled-coordinate products from overflow.
obs Council rota lap: re-read RADIANT_STYLE and KYRI (the voice items) -- the four faculties held whole; led with what is, active voice, compose-not-braid honored by owning only the magnitude read over green-witnessed readings.
